{"ASK_KIDS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Two, a boy and a girl, they're- God, I can't, I can't talk about them without losing it","Three... and I haven't heard from any of them in days, please, if you see them, tell them their mother is looking","One, a baby, ten months... he's with his grandmother, he's safe, he HAS to be","No, none... we tried for years, and now God, I'm so glad we never did","I have a daughter -- she's seven, she loves horses, she draws horses on EVERYTHING, I need to see her again","A son, sixteen, he's got a girlfriend, and a bad attitude, and a good heart, he's out there somewhere","Four, all grown, all moved away, I called each one, and only one picked up, once","I had a little girl, she was four... I- don't make me talk about it, okay?","Twins, boys, they're two, they're with my sister, and she is the best, the BEST, they're fine"}},
{"ASK_KIDS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Had two, buried one... don't ask me for names, I can't","No kids, I'm the end of my line, there's a funny sort of peace in that","A daughter, she's thirteen, tough as nails, she keeps watch, she's better at it than I am","Grandkids -- five of them, I keep their drawings in my coat pocket"}},
{"ASK_KIDS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|hour=16,5",{"Three, and they're all alive, they're in a basement three miles from here, and I'm going to see them tonight"}},
{"ASK_KIDS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"I do, I do, and I'm happy to tell you about them, sit, sit, you're going to like this","Yes! a girl and a boy, and they're the reason I get up in the morning","Want to see a picture?"},false,false,{[3]={{t="I keep it in my sock",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_KIDS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Why? you after my kids?","That's off limits","I don't want to talk about kids, leave it","Why do you want to know about children? Who's asking, and who sent you?"},false,{[4]="GENERIC"}},
