{"ASK_LEADER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"The leader? we don't have one, we sort of, vote, but not really, it's just whoever's loudest","Marge, she's in charge, she was the church secretary, she's bossy, but she keeps us alive","A guy named Hank, he used to be a foreman, he's got a voice like a drill sergeant","Me, I guess, nobody else wanted the job, and now I'm in charge of twelve people, God help me","We don't have one, we just argue until we agree","Nobody -- we're all equal, which is a nice way of saying nobody knows what they're doing","Dad... my dad's in charge, he says so every day, and no one argues","Oh, we don't have one, not really, I guess it's Carol, she just kind of started telling us what to do","Nobody wants to be in charge, so we vote, or shout, depending on the day","I'm not sure, honestly, whoever's the least scared that morning"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Whoever's got the most experience, which changes every week, depending on who's still alive","We have a council of five, we decide together, it's slow, but it works","Teddy, he's the oldest, he's seen the most, he doesn't say much, but when he does, we listen","I'd say we answer to the group, the group answers to common sense","Our leader died on the fourth day, we haven't picked another, it still doesn't feel right..","Nobody, that's the point, we got tired of people giving orders","Marge runs the show, you don't want to cross Marge","Whoever's holding the gun, usually, ha"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Why? you want to talk to somebody who'll tell you the same thing?","Leave my people out of it","Why? So you know who to go after first? No"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","role=civilian_loner",{"I answer to no one... not in the woods, not in the town, not anywhere"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","role=militia",{"Captain's in charge, he's a good man, a hard man, and he doesn't take kindly to visitors"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","role=rescue_clergy",{"The Lord leads us, but on practical matters, Deacon Thomas has the keys"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Captain's the boss, then the lieutenant, then me, we kept the chain of command"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"You'd like our leader, she's fair, she listens, she'd say yes to you","He's the best man I know, a little rough around the edges, but a heart of gold","Between us, I think we should make you a leader, you'd be good at it","We have a council, and they'd be glad to meet you","She's a tough old bird, my aunt, and she's taken a liking to you","It's me, if you want the honest answer, but I'd step down for someone like you","The pastor, usually, but really it's whoever shows up and works hardest","Teddy's the oldest, so, Teddy, but he answers to the group","He's tired, she's tired, everyone's tired, but they lead anyway","Our captain is a quiet man, you'd respect him","We follow the one who cares the most, and that changes by the hour","It's a woman named Rose, and you'd love her","Whoever lasts longest, I guess, and right now it's Mary Alice","We vote on everything, and you'd get a vote","A man who used to run the diner, and he runs this place the same way","There's a committee, God help us","We don't have a king, but we have a conscience","The best leaders don't ask for the job, and neither did he","It's old Mister Carter, a retired principal, you'd like him","Truth is, we rotate, so no one gets too proud","She's a nurse, so she leads like one: calm and firm!!","He led us out of the first night, and we've followed since!","It changes, but the heart doesn't","We call ourselves a family, and that makes Mom the leader","It's whoever stays up latest, which is me, most nights","He's a good man, a bit stubborn, but he'd take you in","She could use a hand, and I'd say you'd be a good one","You'd be welcome to meet them, tell them I sent you","We follow common sense, and the best of us"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"You'll never meet our leader -- I'll see to that","Why? Looking for someone to bribe?","Our leader would have you run out of town","She knows about you, and she's not happy","He'd send you packing, I guarantee it","Leave our leader out of it","Our captain doesn't care for visitors -- especially you","You'd have to get past me first","You want to speak to the boss? Ha!","It's none of your concern","We don't take orders from the likes of you","Our people stick together, and you're not one","I'd sooner introduce you to a firing squad!","You'd better stay out of his way","If you want a boss -- hire a boss","They don't want to meet you","They've been warned about you","It's not your place to ask","She'd have words for you, and not nice ones","Our leader wouldn't give you the time of day","We don't have one for you","He'd have you arrested, if there were police","You'll never get close enough","That's not mine to tell","We're an independent bunch, especially from you!","No audience for you","He's busy, and he's disinclined to meet you","She has NO interest in you!","Why? You looking for another job?","Our leader's name is none of your business"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"I answer to nobody, and if I did I wouldn't tell you","The boss decides, not you, not me","Who's in charge? Whoever's holding the gun, and right now that's me","You want to meet the boss? You really don't","You're talking to the man you need to impress, so impress me"}},
