{"ASK_LEADER","role=law_deputy,law_corrections|st=friendly,neutral",{"Sheriff Cundiff, last I heard, chain of command's a little thin right now"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","role=law_officer|st=friendly,neutral",{"Chief's gone, so the ranking officer is Sergeant Kessinger, he's a good man"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","role=law_trooper|st=friendly,neutral",{"I report to my post commander, the post doesn't answer, so right now I report to me"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","role=law_sheriff,law_sergeant|st=friendly,neutral",{"You're looking at it, the county elected me twice - nobody's held an election since"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=law,swat|st=careful",{"You'll talk to me, not my supervisor - stay right there"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=law,swat|st=hostile",{"I'm in charge of you right now, that's the only chain of command you get"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Team leader, you deal with me"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=military|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Lieutenant's in charge - he's twenty-three, we do what he says, then we do what the sergeant says"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=military|tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"On paper, a colonel at Fort Knox, on this road, me"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=military|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Sergeant Oakes, he's really scary, and really good - please don't mess with him"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=military|st=careful,hostile",{"Command authority is not up for discussion with civilians - step back"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Actual's not here"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=elite|st=careful,hostile",{"Wrong question - move"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=outlaw|st=friendly,neutral",{"Nobody leads me, whole reason I'm out here is so nobody can"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","role=deserter|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"I got out from under one chain of command, I'm not climbing under yours"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=outlaw|st=careful,hostile",{"Asking for the boss is how people get shot - don't"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","role=raider|st=friendly,neutral",{"Big Ricky, you'll know him when he's laughing - that's when you run"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","role=raider_boss,gang_boss|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"You're looking at him, kneel, if it helps you feel better"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","role=gang_member|st=friendly,neutral",{"Shot caller don't talk to strays, you talk to me, and I decide if he hears about you"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","role=biker|st=friendly,neutral",{"The president, you don't talk to the president - you talk to me, and I think about it"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","role=biker_boss|st=friendly,neutral",{"I wear the patch that says president, that settles it"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Big Otis, he ran D-Block, now he runs this - same rules, more room"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=raider,gang,club,prison|st=careful",{"You're not getting anywhere near the top, so quit looking"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=raider,gang,club,prison|st=hostile",{"You wanna speak to management? Management's got a rifle pointed at your knees"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"The man who pays everyone, you won't meet him - that's a kindness"}},
{"ASK_LEADER","reg=crime|st=careful,hostile",{"If you need to ask, you're not meant to know - walk away"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"I don't have the key -- I'm sorry, I wish I did, I'd open it in a heartbeat","Don't touch that, don't, what if someone's inside? what if SOMETHING'S inside?","Try knocking first, softly, listen, and if you hear anything, back away","Locked? Maybe nobody's been in... or somebody's hiding in there, or something hungry","I'm no locksmith, I can barely open a jar, you'd do better asking someone with tools"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Check the frame, the hinges, the window nearby, there's always a weak spot","Kick by the lock, not the middle, one good hit - and quietly, will you","Listen first, always listen, if there's a sound on the other side, you'll know","I've got a crowbar, but it's busy, and I'm not lending it","Locked doors are the best doors, they've been left alone, they've got supplies"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Let's try it together, you take the lock, I'll watch the dark"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Not my door, not my key, not my problem","Find your own way in!"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","role=worker",{"Picks, shims, drill, hammer, there's a dozen ways in, what do you have with you?"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","role=rescue_medical",{"Careful, a locked door might hide a sick person, or worse, wait for my signal.."}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Halligan or axe, but you didn't hear that from me, a door down is a door that doesn't close"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Open it yourself, {g:pal|lady}, I'm not your locksmith","Key? What key? I don't carry keys, I carry crowbars","A locked door's just a suggestion, a boot works wonders","Locked? Break it, who cares, nobody's coming to complain","I could open it, sure, but what's in it for me?"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Open it? I'll open it, with your head!"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"I've got a bent paperclip and some patience, give me a minute and I'll see what I can do"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Locked? Man, that's what shoulders are for","Got a key? Nah, but I know a trick with a credit card","Ain't my door, ain't my problem"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Open it yourself, punk!"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Let me look, I used to be good at this"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"I've opened every lock in this county at one time or another, but I charge a fee","Locked doors are meant to be opened, {g:brother|sister}, with the right persuasion","Do I look like a burglar? Don't answer that"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Give me a minute, I've got a pick in my boot"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"I can open nearly anything, for a price","No. Find another way in. I'm not getting mixed up in whatever you've got going"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"Can't get that open for you, sorry. Try another way in before you break something"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"No, no, I don't open doors, I stay away from doors","Don't ask me to pick locks, they'll say I'm breaking in"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"I won't open it! I won't!"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"I'll try, but I'm not very good at this"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Hatchet works better than any key","If it's locked, there's usually a reason, think before you break it"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"Let me look at it, friend, I've got a few tricks"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"I don't have a key, and I can't authorize forced entry","If it's an emergency, I can break it down, otherwise leave it","Locked isn't the same as abandoned - remember that"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=law|st=hostile",{"Do not attempt to enter, it may be private property"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=law|st=friendly",{"Let me see if the master key works"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"I have no key for that, and forced entry is not authorized"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Stay out of locked buildings!"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=military|st=friendly",{"Let me check if I can help, hold on"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"I don't have a key, I'm sorry, I'm not allowed to carry keys, only my rifle"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"I've got a ring of keys for half the buildings in town, which one is it?","If it belongs to a neighbor, we ask first"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Let me get my key ring, friend, hold on"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly",{"Locked? Oh no, I don't have a key, I'm sorry, did you try knocking? It might be someone inside","Oh, I wish I could help, I'm terrible with locks, it'd make so much noise"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly",{"Kick it, if you must, but think about the noise first","Not my lock, not my problem, but good luck","If it's locked, there's probably a reason, and the reason might be inside"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=family|st=friendly",{"Don't force it, honey, locked doors are locked for a reason"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=law,swat|st=friendly",{"Don't break in, you might be shot, try the knocker"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=military,elite|st=friendly",{"Don't force entry, hostile might be inside"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly",{"Locked door? Give it a kick, give it two, who's gonna stop you?"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Leave it, find another"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","st=friendly,neutral",{"I can't open it for you, a locked door may have someone worried behind it"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","st=careful",{"Don't ask me to break into a place I know nothing about"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","st=hostile",{"A locked door is a hint - take it"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=neutral,friendly",{"I still feel wrong even trying somebody else's doorknob"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=military,swat,elite|st=neutral,careful",{"I'm not clearing a door for you - don't count on that"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"I can't tell you what's on the other side without looking myself"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=worker|st=neutral,friendly",{"Before all this, people paid me to make doors stay shut - funny old world"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=club,outlaw,crime|st=neutral,careful",{"I'm not making noise at a stranger's door on your behalf"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=prison,raider,gang|st=neutral,careful",{"I've spent enough time on the wrong side of locked doors - leave me out of it"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly",{"I can't, I'd break my shoulder before I broke that, it's a steel door"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=family|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly",{"Check under the mat, the flowerpot, the ledge over the light - folks are predictable"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hinges are on your side, pop the pins and it don't matter what the lock's doing"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"Windows - always windows, a door's built to stop you, a window's built to be pretty"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly",{"I won't help with a lock, I'll knock with you, though, sometimes somebody answers"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly",{"Back door, always the back - front's got the deadbolt, back's got a hook and eye"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","role=family_elder|st=friendly,neutral",{"Every house on this road keeps the key in the shed on a nail - every single one"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Somebody hurt behind it, I break it, nobody hurt, I leave it"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","role=law_deputy|st=neutral",{"I've got no warrant and no judge, and I'm still not kicking a door for a stranger"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral|mood=grim",{"I've opened a lot of doors in this county, half of 'em I wish I hadn't"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Don't breach what you can't hold, whatever's inside hears you doing it"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","role=soldier_green|tmp=fresh|st=neutral",{"We had a ram on the truck, never got to use it, and now I want to - that's strange"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=elite|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"A locked door means somebody locked it, work out which side they were on first"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=club|st=neutral",{"Twenty minutes and a screwdriver, or five minutes and I break the window"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","role=crime_member|st=neutral",{"Locks are a hobby of mine - were - are, it's a hobby, and it'll cost you something"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","role=mercenary|st=neutral",{"I open doors for a fee - Fee's food, and I go in first, that's my price list"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"That's a hollow core door, kick the panel, not the lock - two kicks, down low"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=family,civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral|mood=grim",{"Careful what you open... I opened a garage out on Tanner Road and I still hear it"}},
