{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=family|tmp=fresh|st=careful|mood=fear",{"My neighbor's door's been shut since the sixth, I don't want to know - I don't"}},
{"ASK_LOCKED_DOOR","reg=raider|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"I love a locked door, means somebody thought there was something worth locking"}},
